OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, charged with murder and
OL,4,Aattempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has been charged with
OL,7,Fthe murder of a man in Dungannon,
OL,8,FCounty Tyrone, and the attempted murder
OL,9,Fof two other people in the same
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,FThe body of the dead man, who was 61,
OL,13,Fwas found alongside his injured
OL,14,Feight-year-old daughter at a house on
OL,15,FLisnahull Road on Saturday morning,
OL,17,FThe man's 48-year-old wife sustained
OL,18,Fnon-life threatening injuries during
OL,19,Fthe attack.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
